{"parse":{"title":"Spring Rite of the Chosen One","pageid":477539,"revid":2189562,"redirects":[],"text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"mbox stub\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;image mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-stub\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Icon Emoji Paimon&#39;s Paintings 02 Qiqi 2\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"65\" height=\"65\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Icon Emoji Paimon&#39;s Paintings 02 Qiqi 2.png\" data-image-key=\"Icon_Emoji_Paimon%27s_Paintings_02_Qiqi_2.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/f/f7/Icon_Emoji_Paimon%27s_Paintings_02_Qiqi_2.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/65?cb=20240303114600\" /></span></span></div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">This <a href=\"/wiki/Category:Article_Stubs\" title=\"Category:Article Stubs\">page</a> is in need of information.</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-stub\">Can you help out? <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://genshin-impact.fandom.com/wiki/Spring_Rite_of_the_Chosen_One?action=edit\">Click here to add more.</a><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text&#95;&#95;comment\">Unspecified reason</div></div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-stub\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Spring Rite of the Chosen One</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/1/19/Talent_Spring_Rite_of_the_Chosen_One.png/revision/latest?cb=20260812034017\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Talent Spring Rite of the Chosen One\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/1/19/Talent_Spring_Rite_of_the_Chosen_One.png/revision/latest?cb=20260812034017\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/1/19/Talent_Spring_Rite_of_the_Chosen_One.png/revision/latest?cb=20260812034017 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/gensin-impact/images/1/19/Talent_Spring_Rite_of_the_Chosen_One.png/revision/latest?cb=20260812034017 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Talent Spring Rite of the Chosen One\" width=\"128\" height=\"128\" data-image-key=\"Talent_Spring_Rite_of_the_Chosen_One.png\" data-image-name=\"Talent Spring Rite of the Chosen One.png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"character\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Char­ac­ter</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Odette\" title=\"Odette\">Odette</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Talent Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/1st_Ascension_Passive\" title=\"1st Ascension Passive\">1st Ascension Passive</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Category</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ascension_Talent\" title=\"Ascension Talent\">Ascension</a></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDetails\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"info\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">When Odette summons her <span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper giw-extra-effect-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-default mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed giw-extra-effect toggle-tooltip\">Solo Dance Double</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content giw-extra-effect\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-header\">Solo Dance Double</span><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-content\">A psychic double of Odette's that dances a duet with her. May be summoned to the field through her Elemental Skill or Elemental Burst.<br />Alternates between the Plume and Wing dance moves to periodically attack nearby opponents, dealing <span class=\"text-cryo\"><b>AoE Cryo DMG</b></span>.<br />A maximum of one Solo Dance Double summoned by Odette is allowed on the field at any one time.<br /><br />Additionally, when there is a Dance Double summoned by Odette nearby, her Elemental Skill Adagio: Phantom Night Dancers is changed to the special Elemental Skill Adagio: Coda at Dawn's Tolling.</span></span></span>, she also obtains 4 stacks of <span class=\"custom-tt-wrapper giw-extra-effect-wrapper toggle-tooltip mw-collapsible mw-made-collapsible mw-collapsed giw-collapsible\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle mw-collapsible-toggle-default mw-collapsible-toggle-collapsed giw-extra-effect toggle-tooltip\">Marvelous Splendor</span><span class=\"mw-collapsible-content giw-extra-effect\" style=\"display:none\"><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-header\">Marvelous Splendor</span><span class=\"giw-extra-effect-content\">After unlocking the Ascension Talent \"Spring Rite of the Chosen One,\" Odette will obtain a special effect when she summons her Solo Dance Double.<br />Every stack of Marvelous Splendor active increases the character's Stellar Glimmer DMG by 15%. This lasts until her Dance Double exits the field or when she summons her Solo Dance Double again.<br />When Odette is off-field, she loses 1 stack of Marvelous Splendor every second, while other nearby party members gain the corresponding number of Marvelous Splendor stacks at the same time.</span></span></span>.</div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"utility1\">\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><b>Utility</b><ul><li><span class=\"new\" title=\"Stellar Glimmer Reaction DMG Bonus (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvU3RlbGxhcl9HbGltbWVyX1JlYWN0aW9uX0RNR19Cb251cz9hY3Rpb249ZWRpdCZyZWRsaW5rPTE=\">Stellar Glimmer Reaction DMG Bonus</span></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Stellar-Conduct_DMG_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stellar-Conduct DMG Bonus\">Stellar-Conduct DMG Bonus</a></li><li><a href=\"/wiki/Stellar_Swirl_DMG_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Stellar Swirl DMG Bonus\">Stellar Swirl DMG Bonus</a></li></ul></div>\n</div>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<b>Spring Rite of the Chosen One</b> is <a href=\"/wiki/Odette\" title=\"Odette\">Odette</a>'s <a href=\"/wiki/1st_Ascension_Passive\" title=\"1st Ascension Passive\">1st Ascension Passive</a>.\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Trivia\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Trivia</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Other_Languages\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Other Languages</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Change_History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Change History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Navigation\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Navigation</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSpring_Rite_of_the_Chosen_One%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>The name of her 1st Ascension Passive is a reference to the ballet <i><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Rite_of_Spring\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:The Rite of Spring\">The Rite of Spring</a></i> by <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Igor_Stravinsky\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"wikipedia:Igor Stravinsky\">Igor Stravinsky</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Other_Languages\">Other Languages</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSpring_Rite_of_the_Chosen_One%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"article-table\">\n<tbody><tr><th>Language</th><th>Official Name</th><th>Literal Meaning</th></tr><tr><td><b>English</b></td><td>Spring Rite of the Chosen One</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Simplified)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hans\">获选者的春祭</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">Huòxuǎnzhě de Chūnjì</span></i></small></td><td rowspan=\"2\">Spring Rite of the Chosen One</td></tr><tr><td><b>Chinese<br /><small>(Traditional)</small></b></td><td><span lang=\"zh-Hant\">獲選者的春祭</span><br /><small><i><span lang=\"zh-rm\">Huòxuǎnzhě de Chūnjì</span></i></small></td></tr><tr><td><b>Japanese</b></td><td><span lang=\"ja\">選ばれし者の祝祭</span><br /><small><i>Erabareshi-mono no Shukusai</i></small></td><td>Feast of the Chosen One</td></tr><tr><td><b>Korean</b></td><td><span lang=\"ko\">봄의</span> <span lang=\"ko\">제전</span><br /><small><i>Bomui Jejeon</i></small></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Spanish</b></td><td>Primavera de la elegida</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>French</b></td><td>Printemps de l'<span lang=\"fr\">é</span>lue</td><td>Spring of the Chosen One</td></tr><tr><td><b>Russian</b></td><td><span lang=\"ru\">Весеннее</span> <span lang=\"ru\">жертвоприношение</span> <span lang=\"ru\">избранницы</span><br /><small><i>Vesenneye zhertvoprinosheniye izbrannitsy</i></small></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Thai</b></td><td>Spring Rite of the Chosen One</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Vietnamese</b></td><td><span lang=\"vi\">Lễ Xuân Của Người Được Chọn</span></td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>German</b></td><td>Fr<span lang=\"de\">ü</span>hling der Auserw<span lang=\"de\">ä</span>hlten</td><td>Spring Rite of the Chosen</td></tr><tr><td><b>Indonesian</b></td><td>Spring Rite of the Chosen One</td><td>&#8212;</td></tr><tr><td><b>Portuguese</b></td><td>Primavera do Escolhido</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Turkish</b></td><td>Se<span lang=\"tr\">ç</span>ilmi<span lang=\"tr\">ş</span> Ki<span lang=\"tr\">ş</span>inin Bahar Ayini</td><td></td></tr><tr><td><b>Italian</b></td><td>Rito primaverile della Prescelta</td><td>Spring Rite of the Chosen One</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Change_History\">Change History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fgenshin-impact.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FSpring_Rite_of_the_Chosen_One%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"change-history\"><div class=\"change-history-header\"><div>Released in <b><a hre